Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "Hmmm? A visitor, here?\p"
	.string "What are you doing in this kind of\n"
	.string "place, kid?\p"
	.string "What am I doing here?\p"
	.string "Well, I lived here for the last forty\n"
	.string "years. This is my home!\p"
	.string "OK, now you can go...$"

Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "Wait! I’ll give you this EGG I found\n"
	.string "if you don’t tell anyone I’m living\l"
	.string "here, OK?$"

Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_3::
	.string "As you wish, I’ll keep the EGG then…$"

Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_4::
	.string "Well, I don’t have anything else for\n"
	.string "you. Don’t forget to keep your\l"
	.string "promise!$"

Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_5::
	.string "But, you need to have some space\n"
	.string "for it in your party!$"

Route11_Cave1_Text_OldMan1_6::
	.string "I don’t know what could be inside of\n"
	.string "that EGG.\p"
	.string "Just be kind to it.\p"
	.string "And don’t forget our promise!$"
